{
  "_readme": [
    "The soundtrack: Todd Grilliot, 'Demos for Days'.",
    "",
    "`theme` plays first and then every other track, so the running order is",
    "theme, random, theme, random... The random pick is drawn from `shuffle`",
    "and never repeats the track that was picked last time round.",
    "",
    "To drop a track, delete its line from `shuffle`. To add one, put the mp3",
    "in music/ and add a { file, title } entry. To change what plays first,",
    "move a track into `theme`."
